%description:
Tests the AccECN negotiation and the ACE field (RFC 9768) with
tcpEcnMode="accecn" on both hosts. The SYN sets AE, CWR and ECE. The SYN-ACK
feeds back the Not-ECT SYN with ACE 0b010 (Table 2), and the ACK of the
SYN-ACK feeds back the Not-ECT SYN-ACK with ACE 0b010 (Table 3). The data is
ECT(0). The ACE field starts at 5 and counts the CE mark on A004 (ACE 6). The
client halves cwnd as for an ECN-Echo (section 3.1.5) and sends no CWR. The
data of the server also carries the ACE field.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 3000"
*.srv_app.sendScript="2.0 1000"
*.tcptester.script="a4 ce"
*.*_tcp.accEcnOptionEnabled = false # the ACE field alone (tcp_accecn_option_* test the option)
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A W ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1025(1024) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1025 win 16384 
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1025:2049(1024) ack 501 win 16384 CE # marking CE
[1.407 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 2049 win 16384 
[1.409 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 2049:3001(952) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
[1.611 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 3001 win 16384 
[2.001 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N 501:1501(1000) ack 3001 win 16384 ECT(0) 
[2.203 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N ack 1501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
AccECN: ACE=6, packets acknowledged=1, new CE marks=1 (mod 8: 1)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
cwnd = cwnd / 2: received ECN-Echo ACK... new cwnd = 1024
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
